// ===========================================================================
// The 4 pure-math LUTs (FmPitchTableZ / PsgDivisorTableZ / LogVolumeLutZ /
// CarrierMaskTableZ) + the PSG/FM vol-env id-lists, intra-module pointer
// tables, and bodies. BANKED at the engine-table head (soundBankHead, VMA
// $8000); the resident FM/PSG writers read the 8 head labels via the seam-1
// banked carriers at their fixed VMAs, so the byte-exact $8000-based layout
// is load-bearing. SHAPE-INVARIANT (855 bytes both shapes). The vol-env scan
// counts are pub consts DERIVED from the id-list emitted spans via the
// comptime `span(...)` primitive, and the deleted AS twin's id/ptr count
// guard is revived as an item-position `ensure`.
// ===========================================================================

